WEBVTT

00:11.960 --> 00:12.720
Your Majesty

00:12.800 --> 00:14.467
Prince of Jin has arrived

00:14.720 --> 00:15.520
Your son

00:15.600 --> 00:17.000
Pays respects to Father

00:19.040 --> 00:20.440
Rise

00:21.320 --> 00:22.360
Thank you, Father

00:22.440 --> 00:24.040
The rooster hasn't even crowed

00:24.320 --> 00:25.880
Rushing to see me

00:26.320 --> 00:27.720
What's the matter?

